    "CPU timings: three independent processes each at 1 and 4 configured threads; native kernels remain serial. Context creation excluded; input copies, eager graph construction, loss, backward and gradient collection included.",
    "All six cases return the loss, all real parameter gradients and the full complex input gradient. Ordinary tensor composition repeated timings cover 10 layers only.",
